regress\artifacts\lcabadval\panel_p1_20260907\ollama_kimi.txt:1:**VERDICT: Premise 6 does not survive contact with Premise 2. The author's own field census gives `ioc_conf` exactly one honored consumer, so "the model consumes these fields for nothing" is false for one arm and A-as-uniform is not licensed. For the other five arms Premise 6 is sound — but the sound version is "#447's ICR cell: no honored state to corrupt," not "the lie is pre-existing." The fork as posed (one answer for the file) repeats the exact error the #447 census inlines a warning against. Disposition: split per arm — decline or mask-and-accept for `LCA_IOC_CONF`; drop-exit-plus-announce for the five pure-storage arms. B is dominated for the five: it makes the register file lie (write X, read back old) while fixing nothing, since the accepted-value lie survives B too.**
