regress\artifacts\sgirandompixel\design_panel\ollama_minimax.txt:17:- DECLINE (silent) and DECLINE+LATCHED ANNOUNCE: both leave `*color` untouched, so the destination is written with the caller's `fg`. The brief itself flags this as "plausible-looking wrong data rather than obviously wrong data" -- a strictly worse failure mode than today's random(), and the announce adds nothing the witness can't already see.
regress\artifacts\sgirandompixel\design_panel\ollama_minimax.txt:18:- ACCEPT / BACKED ACCEPT: the structural warrant (`re_linear_b[]` exists, same write path, real CRIME hardware treats A/B as parallel tile tables) is strong, but the addition licence requires a measured delta or a transferred warrant -- not "it cannot hurt." A witness row that *measures* `copy lin_b == source` post-fix is exactly that delta, but the seat that ships ACCEPT without first taking that measurement ships invented behaviour. FAULT does not.
regress\artifacts\sgirandompixel\design_panel\grok.txt:1:I'll check the four premises against `GXEMUL-SEC/src/` first, then decide the option-set member and what happens to `*color` from the arm and its callers.Premises look plausible so far; next I’ll read the function, callers, and how LIN_A vs LIN_B are actually stored.MTE already treats LIN_B as the other linear array; I’ll read that path, the DE mode stores, latches, and the witness probe next.Checking whether a real driver programs `DE_MODE_LIN_B`, and how `FAULT` is dispatched from this call path.**MEMBER 3: DECLINE + LATCHED ANNOUNCE; `*color` UNTOUCHED.** All four numbered premises hold.
regress\artifacts\sgirandompixel\design_panel\grok.txt:40:`lin_b is fg` is the inverting oracle. It is also the discriminator against the rejected dispositions: zero leaves `0`, skip-PUT leaves `0x11111111`, IMPLEMENT-as-copy leaves `0xaabbccdd`. `lin_b diag once` is the discriminator against silent decline (member 2). Drop `lin_b written` as a defect row; under this member it is true before and after.
regress\artifacts\sgirandompixel\design_panel\grok.txt:49:- `tlb_mode` 3/6/7 share this `default:` with `LIN_B`. One junk-mode row is cheap sibling parity if the detector is extended; not required to ship the decline.
