tools/pipeline/ledger.json-32825-     "note": "FIX DESIGN.  VERDICT: \"7 requires LCA wiring plus Alpha CPU/PALcode work.  This tree can latch an IRQ level but cannot deliver an asynchronous Alpha guest interrupt.  My interim choice is a diagnosed stop of guest emulation.\"  Denominator: 36/36 registration call sites in 28 files, 35 assert/deassert pairs = 70 callbacks -- INDEPENDENTLY MATCHING this row's own census of 70.  Supplies a discriminating row, which both witness contracts said was missing."
